  "ruleText": "Saf-C 9407.02 Appeals. Any appeal of a removal or disciplinary action hearing may be appealed to the superior court pursuant to RSA 106-B:31, XIV.\n\nSource. #13550, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 1-31-23, EXPIRES: 7-30-23; ss by #13653, eff 5-26-23",
